;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'营收'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bar'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        data: data.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d.revenue),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        yAxisIndex: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'订单量'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'line'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        data: data.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d.orders),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        yAxisIndex: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        smooth: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  chart.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setOption</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(option);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chart;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Option 的核心配置模块：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模块</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>关键属性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>title</td>\n<td>标题区域</td>\n<td>text, subtext, left</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tooltip</td>\n<td>悬浮提示</td>\n<td>trigger, formatter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>legend</td>\n<td>图例</td>\n<td>data, orient, selected</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>xAxis/yAxis</td>\n<td>直角坐标轴</td>\n<td>type, data, name</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>series</td>\n<td>数据系列</td>\n<td>type, data, name</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dataset</td>\n<td>数据集</td>\n<td>source, dimensions</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>grid</td>\n<td>布局区域</td>\n<td>left, right, top, bottom</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dataZoom</td>\n<td>数据缩放</td>\n<td>type, start, end</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"dataset-数据集模式\">Dataset 数据集模式</h2><p>ECharts 4+ 引入的 Dataset 模式将数据管理从 Series 中分离出来，实现数据与视觉映射的解耦。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const createDatasetChart = (container: HTMLElement): echarts.ECharts =&gt; {&#10;  const chart = echarts.init(container);&#10;&#10;  const option: echarts.EChartsOption = {&#10;    dataset: {&#10;      source: [&#10;        [&#39;产品&#39;, &#39;Q1&#39;, &#39;Q2&#39;, &#39;Q3&#39;, &#39;Q4&#39;],&#10;        [&#39;前端框架&#39;, 120, 150, 180, 210],&#10;        [&#39;后端服务&#39;, 80, 95, 110, 130],&#10;        [&#39;移动端&#39;, 60, 75, 90, 105],&#10;        [&#39;基础设施&#39;, 40, 50, 65, 80],&#10;      ],&#10;    },&#10;    xAxis: { type: &#39;category&#39; },&#10;    yAxis: {},&#10;    series: [{ type: &#39;bar&#39; }, { type: &#39;bar&#39; }, { type: &#39;bar&#39; }, { type: &#39;bar&#39; }],&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  chart.setOption(option);&#10;  return chart;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createDatasetChart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">container</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> echarts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F